# Home's notes, stickers and ink. Desktop parity slice 5b (2026-10-28) moved their model and drawing into the shared
# code (:chat) so the desktop's dashboard draws them too: the phone's home must do all of it as before, cover and
# unfolded, and what was on its pages must still load. Run before and after such a change and compare the shots.
fold open
# Home with nothing open or selected. Home pressed at home opens the app list, so Back after it: Back closes the list
# and lets go of a selected sticker, and does nothing at plain home.
key HOME
wait 1500
key BACK
key BACK
wait 1000
shot unfolded-home-before
# A sticky note from the drawing tools, its words typed, kept.
tap Open drawing tools
tap sticky note
expect delete
type walk note one
tap done
expect walk note one
# Look: the note, pink, with its words, on the page (clear of tiles where the page has room).
shot unfolded-note-placed
# Lifted with a long press and carried to the empty right page.
drag walk note one to 0.70 0.62
expect walk note one
# Look: the note now on Page 2, lower right, nothing else moved.
shot unfolded-note-moved
# Tapped: its menu; deleted.
tap walk note one
expect delete
tap delete
absent walk note one
# A sticker: the heart, second of the drawn ones.
tap Open drawing tools
tap sticker
expect stick on this page
tap 0.41 0.493
wait 1200
# Look: a pink heart on Page 2 under the apps, selected: a handle at its corner and "turn · delete" above it.
shot unfolded-sticker-placed
expect delete
# Carried by its middle, found under its "turn · delete" bar (where it lands depends on what is on the page).
drag turn offset 20dp 60dp to 0.80 0.66
wait 800
# Look: the heart lower down on Page 2, still selected.
shot unfolded-sticker-moved
tap delete
wait 800
# Look: no heart.
shot unfolded-sticker-deleted
# Ink: the pen draws on Page 2's empty part.
tap Open drawing tools
expect undo
swipe 0.55 0.45 0.72 0.62 600
wait 800
# Look: a blue stroke on Page 2.
shot unfolded-ink-drawn
tap undo
wait 800
# Look: the stroke gone.
shot unfolded-ink-undone
tap redo
wait 800
# Look: the stroke back.
shot unfolded-ink-redone
tap undo
tap close drawing tools
# The same on the cover screen (its own page, its own tools band).
fold folded
key HOME
wait 1500
key BACK
key BACK
wait 1000
shot cover-home-before
tap Open drawing tools
tap sticky note
expect delete
type walk note two
tap done
expect walk note two
# Look: the note on the cover's page, clear of the tiles.
shot cover-note-placed
drag walk note two to 0.5 0.62
expect walk note two
# Look: the note lower down, nothing else moved.
shot cover-note-moved
tap walk note two
expect delete
tap delete
absent walk note two
tap Open drawing tools
tap sticker
expect stick on this page
tap 0.325 0.494
wait 1200
# Look: the heart on the page, selected, "turn · delete" above it.
shot cover-sticker-placed
expect delete
drag turn offset 20dp 60dp to 0.6 0.66
wait 800
# Look: the heart lower down, still selected.
shot cover-sticker-moved
tap delete
wait 800
# Look: no heart.
shot cover-sticker-deleted
tap Open drawing tools
expect undo
swipe 0.3 0.55 0.7 0.7 600
wait 800
# Look: a blue stroke across the cover's empty part.
shot cover-ink-drawn
tap undo
wait 800
# Look: the stroke gone.
shot cover-ink-undone
tap redo
wait 800
# Look: the stroke back.
shot cover-ink-redone
tap undo
tap close drawing tools
fold open
# Pen marks wiped by the agents' bridge (only on the phone, where Linux and the bridge run).
[phone] Draw a few strokes on a page, then from Phone A run `oma-phone ink clear`: the strokes go at once, the answer says how many, notes and stickers stay; the tools' undo brings the strokes back
[phone] On Boss's own home: the notes, stickers and ink already on his pages show after updating, in the same places, with the same words
